  "description": "Michael is the eldest son of the global corporation Auber and an heir who sparks curiosity with his noble and enigmatic image. Known for his cold-heartedness, the young master does not fire his personal secretary, Lee Kang-Ju, even when he smashes dozens of expensive plates and destroys hundreds of laptops and external hard drives containing important data. Because that is love. While Michael is tormented by his inability to express his feelings despite keeping him by his side, he injures his hand due to Kang-Ju's mistake. Holding Kang-Ju accountable, he becomes Michael's hand, and the two naturally grow closer... What will be the end of this precarious relationship between the bumbling secretary and the young master who has a crush on him?\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
